</prior>
{% else %}
OVERWRITE the file at `{{ output_path }}` with a structured final summary using these sections:

## Summary
One paragraph: what was accomplished, overall outcome, total issues resolved vs failed.

## Problems
List every failure, timeout, and significant delay. For each: root cause (from transcript), impact, and whether it resolved. If there were no problems, write "None." and move on.

## Prompt & Workflow Issues
Specific flaws found in worker prompts or workflow configuration — things like: workers misunderstanding tasks, missing context in prompts, wrong decomposition granularity, dependency ordering issues. For each, quote evidence and suggest a fix. If none, write "None."

## Recommendations
Actionable improvements ranked by impact. Only include items the user can actually change (prompt wording, timeouts, worker config, task decomposition). Do not recommend things that are already working fine.
